<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 5.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 5.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    92/93     99/100     UNQ     187/188</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   98/99    103/105   193/195   205/208</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Few enquiries kept the Singapore bunker market listless on Monday and traders said they did not expect enquiries to improve in the near term. Majors said they would stay on the sidelines instead of lowering offers and traders noted shipowners turned to other ports with competitive prices.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
